for postgraduate researchers on high-impact journal publication, APA referencing, and statistical tools.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"workshop footer row\">\n                        <span class=\"text-stone-500\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"workshop location\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-location-dot text-[#701500] mr-1\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"location pin icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            Social Sciences Hall\n                        </span>\n                        <a class=\"font-bold text-[#701500] hover:underline\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"workshop details link\" href=\"news.html\">\n                            Details →\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <!-- 9. SECTION 06: STUDENT ACCESS DESK & UTILITY GATEWAY -->\n    <section class=\"py-14 px-6 bg-white border-b border-stone-200\" data-kid=\"2-9\" data-name=\"student access desk section\" id=\"student-desk\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\" data-kid=\"2-9-1\" data-name=\"section content wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"bg-stone-900 text-white rounded-lg p-8 lg:p-10\" data-kid=\"2-9-1-1\" data-name=\"student resources dark panel\">\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center\" data-kid=\"2-9-1-1-1\" data-name=\"resources panel grid\">\n                    <div class=\"lg:col-span-6\" data-kid=\"2-9-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"resources heading group\">\n                        <span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-wider\" data-kid=\"2-9-1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"student desk label\">\n                            Student Academic Desk\n      